'''Heracrist''' (ヘラクライスト ''Herakuraisuto'') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemy that appears in the [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Heracrist
|image = E 520.png
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
|appearance = [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
Heracrist is an enemy somewhat similar to [[One Horn]], with few knockbacks and very high health and damage, but short range and slow movement speed. Compared to One Horn, Heracrist trades off a rapid attack rate and Area Attack for longer range and Omni Strike for extra accuracy.

